From 7895fab7f634324455644ff0174b461734dcd6ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:23:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] kernel: NX2NAVI_STALL_MS (default 0, off) logs, for a present
 at least that long after the previous one, where each busy guest thread spent
 the interval: kernel states (run/core/host/sleep/sync/...), host CPU and
 run-queue time from schedstat, and page faults

---
 runtime/cfg.c    |  3 +-
 runtime/host.h   |  1 +
 runtime/kernel.c | 90 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 runtime/perf.c   |  1 +
 4 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

